name issue_23_outage_3s
describe 3 s outage (tunnel) in the middle of the call: the receiver asks for keyframes as libwebrtc does
# Issue #23 (partial): the receiver asks for a keyframe only where libwebrtc does (NackRequester + RtpVideoStreamReceiver2).
# Target (issue #23): video.keyframe_requests within 2x of libwebrtc or within 2 requests (libwebrtc: 1) on seeds 1-5
# without raising video.longest_freeze_ms; this scenario locks the request count only (see docs/fixes/23-libwebrtc-keyframe-policy.md, Remaining).
keyframe v2
duration 30s
at 0s  capacity=1500kbps delay=30ms queue=300ms
at 12s down
at 15s up
reverse at 0s delay=30ms
reverse at 12s down
reverse at 15s up
expect video.keyframe_requests <= 3
